\item[S2] Suchanda Roy and Ramesh Hariharasubramanian, Characterization of Word-Representable Near-Triangulations, arXiv:2605.25733v1 (2026), Sections 1--2, near-triangulation definition and word-representability. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2605.25733v1}.
\item[S3] Magnus M. Halldórsson, Sergey Kitaev and Artem Pyatkin, Semi-Transitive Orientations and Word-Representable Graphs, arXiv:1501.07108v1 (2015), Section 1, definitions and general orientation characterization. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1501.07108v1}.
